## Action required

**⚠️ Important — idempotency impact:** The 5 stale releases (`vi_modis_dynamic_raster`, `vi_viirs_dynamic_raster`, `burn_dates_modis_raster`, `burn_dates_viirs_raster`, `vi_modis_dynamic`) contain real data. Because `gh_release_has_asset()` checks the new tag names, the pipeline will **not** find existing files in the old releases and will re-download/re-process them. With the current narrow `2026-03-01` start date this is fine. For a full historical backfill you'd need to either rename the GitHub releases manually or copy assets to the new tags before running.

**Recommended cleanup** — delete these 24 releases (2 orphans + 22 legacy):  
`fire_history`, `dynamic_modis_vi`, and all 20 `clean_*`, `raw_*`, `processed_*`, `v1.0`, `current` releases from 2022–2024.